        "payload": "tree c6d03d0fb011b5a9b120589de82630a2d2bb934e\nparent 94b60541c28e7aff73e1dfd7719c591215cd63f7\nparent 4fd7634f32ffbb4fd4c09b757aa16327626a1749\nauthor Weikai Kong <priv@pppig236.com> 1746074626 -0400\ncommitter Weikai Kong <priv@pppig236.com> 1746074626 -0400\n\nMerge tag 'ASB-2025-04-05_12-5.10' of https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common into lineage-22.2\n\nhttps://source.android.com/docs/security/bulletin/2025-04-01\nCVE-2024-50264\nCVE-2024-53197\nCVE-2024-56556\nCVE-2024-53150\n\n# By Michal Luczaj (3) and others\n# Via Treehugger Robot\n* tag 'ASB-2025-04-05_12-5.10' of https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/common:\n  UPSTREAM: net: sched: Disallow replacing of child qdisc from one parent to another\n  UPSTREAM: pfifo_tail_enqueue: Drop new packet when sch->limit == 0\n  UPSTREAM: vsock: Orphan socket after transport release\n  UPSTREAM: vsock: Keep the binding until socket destruction\n  UPSTREAM: bpf, vsock: Invoke proto::close on close()\n  BACKPORT: f2fs: compress: fix inconsistent update of i_blocks in release_compress_blocks and reserve_compress_blocks\n  ANDROID: SPF: Fix swap faults racing with fast-mremap\n",
